  <h1>The traffic around you, in your pocket.</h1>
  <p class="page-hero-subtitle">
    skyBlip Go broadcasts your position in ADS-L, receives everyone
    else&rsquo;s and tells you where to look.
  </p>
  <p class="page-hero-audience">
    From light aircraft to skydivers, by way of microlights, gliders,
    gyroplanes and paragliders.<br>Nothing to install on board, no
    subscription.
  </p>

  <figure class="hero-figure">
    <%= pages_image_tag "skyblip-go-techo.avif", alt: "skyBlip Go: a white case with its antenna, the traffic radar on its e-paper screen" %>
